msgid ""
"Graph any flight data by first clicking on the appropriate row, you should "
"see the column headers update appropriately. Next find the column you wish "
"to graph, click on it and then push the \"Graph this data\" button. In the "
"example above the ATT's Roll-In and Roll data have been graphed. The mouse's"
" scroll wheel can be used to zoom in or out. You may also select an area of "
"the graph to zoom in on it. Zoom out by right-mouse-button clicking and "
"selecting \"Set Scale to Default\". `Here's "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blog/show?id=705844%3ABlogPost%3A801607>`__"
" a mini tutorial on using this feature. You may also filter on just the "
"first column (the flight data message type) by clicking on the first column "
"and selecting the message type from the drop-down. This is very useful "
"especially for viewing the different flight modes (called \"MODE\" messages)"
" used during the mission. Click the first column again but press \"Cancel\" "
"to clear the filter."
msgstr ""
"首先单击相应行以绘制任意飞行数据图表，列标题应相应更新。然后找到要绘制的列，单击它并按「Graph this "
"data」按钮。上例中绘制了ATT的Roll-In和Roll数据。可使用鼠标滚轮缩放。您也可以选择图表的某个区域进行放大。右键单击并选择「Set "
"Scale to Default」可缩小。`这里 "
"<https://www.diydrones.com/profiles/blog/show?id=705844%3ABlogPost%3A801607>`__"
" "
"有一个使用此功能的迷你教程。您也可以通过单击第一列并从下拉菜单中选择消息类型来仅按第一列（飞行数据消息类型）筛选。这对于查看任务中使用的不同飞行模式（称为「MODE」消息）特别有用。再次单击第一列并按「Cancel」可清除筛选。"

